Hellsmouth is a chain of Joker worlds where something is thought to have gone wrong in the core of each planet. The ground is unusually restless, and fire elementals and others that like the heat live there. Their people make weapons, because the wars they fight need them.

Hellsmouth lies across its border from [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Glacier|Glacier]], and the two are at war.
